<title>USA: Saint Luke's/Shawnee, Kan., repriced, ylds raised.</title>
<headline>Saint Luke's/Shawnee, Kan., repriced, ylds raised.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>PaineWebber Inc said Wednesday it repriced Saint Luke's/Shawnee Mission Health System, Kan.'s $77.2 million bond issue, raising yields in several maturities but leaving the top yield in 2026 unchanged at 5.582 percent.</p>
